   - The dependent variable (Y) is the height of the wheat plants at the 4th week.
   - The independent variable (X) is the type of fertilizer, with each fertilizer being a categorical variable (e.g., Fertilizer A, Fertilizer B, Fertilizer C, Fertilizer D).

