     - C: \( \frac{10}{3.5} \approx 2.86 \)
     - H: \( \frac{14.4}{3.5} \approx 3.57 \)
     - N: \( \frac{3.5}{3.5} = 1 \)
   - Round the whole number ratio to the nearest whole number:
     - C: 3, H: 4, N: 1
   - The empirical formula is \( \text{C}_3\text{H}_4\text{N} \).

