2. **Calculate the speed for Lucy:**
   - Speed of Lucy: \(90 \text{ steps/min} \times 55 \text{ cm/step} = 4500 \text{ cm/min}\)
   - Convert to meters per minute: \(4500 \text{ cm/min} \div 100 \text{ cm/m} = 45 \text{ m/min}\)

