   - Time for Lucy: \(106 \text{ m} \div 45 \text{ m/min} \approx 2.3 \text{ min}\)
   - Round to the nearest minute: \(2.3 \text{ min} \approx 2 \text{ min}\)

4. **Calculate the total time for Lucy:**
   - Total time for Lucy: \(2 \text{ min} \times 11 = 22 \text{ min}\)

