z = \frac{-2\sqrt{3}i}{3 + \sqrt{3}i}
\]

Multiply the numerator and denominator by the conjugate of the denominator:

\[
z = \frac{-2\sqrt{3}i}{3 + \sqrt{3}i} \cdot \frac{3 - \sqrt{3}i}{3 - \sqrt{3}i} = \frac{-6\sqrt{3}i + 3i^2}{9 - 3i^2}
\]

