     E_{\text{HMTD}} = \frac{(1000 \times 1.0 - 1.0 \times 1.0)}{(1 - 1.4)} = -300 \, \text{bar L}
     \]
     Convert bar L to J:
     \[
     E_{\text{HMTD}} = -300 \times 10^5 \, \text{J}
     \]
     (1 bar L = \( 10^5 \) J)

