   The dissociation reaction is:  
   \[
   \text{N}_2\text{O}_4 \rightleftharpoons 2\text{NO}_2.
   \]
   The equilibrium constant \( K_p \) is given by:  
   \[
   K_p = \frac{P_{\text{NO}_2}^2}{P_{\text{N}_2\text{O}_4}}.
